  {
   "id": "tyrant-s-realm-177253@major-2025-03-12",
   "gameId": "tyrant-s-realm-177253",
   "displayName": "Tyrant's Realm – Free Content Update Now Live!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-12T17:01:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Greetings, warriors of the Realm!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A brand-new free content update has arrived in Tyrant’s Realm, bringing fresh challenges and rewards to those brave enough to face them. Whether you’re a seasoned fighter or a newcomer looking to sharpen your skills, this update has something for everyone. Here’s what’s new:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Master the Art of Boss Parrying",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Test your reflexes against the fiercest foes! The long-requested Boss Parrying system is now live, giving you the power to counter and turn the tide of battle against even the deadliest adversaries. Precision and timing are key—perfect your parries and dominate the battlefield!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "New Challenges for High Difficulty Modes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "For those seeking an even greater test of skill, we’ve introduced new challenges for the highest difficulty levels. Sharpen your strategies, push your limits, and prove you have what it takes to conquer the Realm’s toughest trials.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "24 New Challenge Chest Rewards & New Cosmetic Outfits",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Complete the Challenges and unlock 24 brand-new rewards from Challenge Chests! These exclusive items will push you to complete objectives faster and more efficiently—only the most dedicated challengers will claim them all.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Additionally, the Challenge Chest now holds new cosmetic outfits, allowing you to customize your warrior’s look as you battle through the Realm. Earn them by completing challenges and stand out among your fellow champions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Update Now and Prove Your Might!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This free update is available now—jump back into Tyrant’s Realm and test your skills against these new trials. Let us know what you think, and as always, we’ll see you in the fight!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay sharp, stay relentless, and rule the Realm!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
